---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+16105550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(610) 555-0199';
---
<Layout 
  title="About Us | HVAC Repair Phoenixville PA"
  description="Local licensed HVAC technicians serving Phoenixville and Chester County. Same-day service, honest pricing, written guarantee."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → About Us</div>
      <h1>About HVAC Repair Phoenixville</h1>
      <p>Local technicians focused on honest diagnosis, quality repairs, and keeping Phoenixville homes comfortable year-round.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Our Approach</h2>
      <p>We believe HVAC service should be straightforward: diagnose accurately, explain clearly, quote before work begins, and stand behind the repair. No pressure tactics, no mystery fees.</p>
      <p>Based at 25 Gay St in Phoenixville, we serve homeowners and small businesses throughout Chester County. Our technicians carry common parts so most jobs finish on the first visit.</p>
      <h2>What Sets Us Apart</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>True same-day and emergency availability</li>
        <li>Licensed and insured for Pennsylvania</li>
        <li>Upfront written estimates</li>
        <li>Workmanship guarantee on repairs</li>
        <li>Familiarity with local housing stock and climate demands</li>
      </ul>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-outline-dark" style="margin-left:0.75rem">Contact Form</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
